  "full_text": "Like one time, like I was on the back of Leo's motorcycle and he's like hauling ass like going 100 and I'm like going 100. Another time, like cops saved my life. A bunch of people like show up at mystery times. So like, but you know what? Did I tell you about my cruise control? I think I got a fucking radar gun built in this fucker. Yeah, you know what? I gunned it one time over at this one place. I think it's got a sensor on the accelerator to see if it's like real or fucking showing off. Either that or they got like a remote control on my car. Like, no, we can't let Jerry get busted. So they gotta like, like, like override his car. So they, the fucker, man. I was a fucking, it's a fucking James Bond car, man. Fucking sellers. Picking gravel. Oh my God. But then like the other day, I like gunned it and the thing like choked. I was like, what? Like I was like showing off or something. Like I was, I made the mistake of like, oh, let's go drive around town without my lights on for a little bit to have some fun. But I don't like that. I'm back in like the private area. Oh my god. Mistake.",
